[ti:Molly Malone (Cockles and Mussels)]
[ar:Traditional Irish song]
[00:02.26]In Dublin fair city where girls are so pretty
[00:09.62]I first set my eyes on sweet Molly Malone
[00:16.98]As she wheeled her wheelbarrow
[00:22.64]Through streets broad and narrow
[00:28.30]Crying cockles and mussels alive alive oh
